        "created_at": "2016-04-25T22:07:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is it possible to gain enough Crowd Favor in the colosseum to win in a single round? I'm inclined to say no, because it doesn't seem like there's enough going on, even with a 5-hero team, to get 20 points that quickly right off the bat.</p><p>Anyone got a strategy that would work?</p>",
