        "raw": "<p>Is it possible to gain enough Crowd Favor in the colosseum to win in a single round? I&#39;m inclined to say no, because it doesn&#39;t seem like there&#39;s enough going on, even with a 5-hero team, to get 20 points that quickly right off the bat.</p><p>Anyone got a strategy that would work?</p>",
